   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Those are real differences in change cadence, data shape and ownership. The general principle, stated concretely: SPLIT WHEN\nTHE REASONS TO CHANGE DIFFER, NOT WHEN THE NOUNS DIFFER.",
