  {
   "id": "cl",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 850,
   "width": 636,
   "height": 21,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100055,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700385,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The reservation path - 3/sec, and the only path that matters",
   "originalText": "The reservation path - 3/sec, and the only path that matters",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "wp",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 888,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 250,
   "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
   "backgroundColor": "#1e293b",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100056,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700392,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "wp_t",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 38,
   "y": 893,
   "width": 884,
   "height": 240,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100057,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700399,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "BEGIN TRANSACTION                                  <- the atomicity boundary\n  1. INSERT INTO reservation (reservation_id, ..., status='pending')\n       -> UNIQUE(reservation_id) violation => this is a REPLAY:\n          roll back and return the ORIGINAL reservation\n  2. UPDATE room_type_inventory\n        SET total_reserved = total_reserved + :n\n      WHERE hotel_id = ? AND room_type_id = ?\n        AND date >= ? AND date < ?\n        AND total_reserved + :n <= total_inventory * 1.10\n       -> affected rows < nights requested => ROLLBACK, return 409\nCOMMIT\n\n  3. call the payment service          <- OUTSIDE the transaction\n       success -> UPDATE reservation SET status='confirmed'\n       failure -> status='payment_failed', and release the inventory\n  4. publish ReservationConfirmed  ->  notifications, CDC to the cache",
   "originalText": "BEGIN TRANSACTION                                  <- the atomicity boundary\n  1. INSERT INTO reservation (reservation_id, ..., status='pending')\n       -> UNIQUE(reservation_id) violation => this is a REPLAY:\n          roll back and return the ORIGINAL reservation\n  2. UPDATE room_type_inventory\n        SET total_reserved = total_reserved + :n\n      WHERE hotel_id = ? AND room_type_id = ?\n        AND date >= ? AND date < ?\n        AND total_reserved + :n <= total_inventory * 1.10\n       -> affected rows < nights requested => ROLLBACK, return 409\nCOMMIT\n\n  3. call the payment service          <- OUTSIDE the transaction\n       success -> UPDATE reservation SET status='confirmed'\n       failure -> status='payment_failed', and release the inventory\n  4. publish ReservationConfirmed  ->  notifications, CDC to the cache",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "wp",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 888,
   "width": 584,
   "height": 90,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100058,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700406,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Step 3 being outside the transaction is the single most important structural\ndecision on this path. A payment provider call takes hundreds of milliseconds\nto seconds and can time out. Inside the transaction, the inventory row lock\nwould be held for that entire duration - serializing every other booking for\nthat hotel and room type behind one slow payment. At peak season with genuine\ncontention on a popular hotel, that turns a 3/sec system into an unusable one.",
   "originalText": "Step 3 being outside the transaction is the single most important structural\ndecision on this path. A payment provider call takes hundreds of milliseconds\nto seconds and can time out. Inside the transaction, the inventory row lock\nwould be held for that entire duration - serializing every other booking for\nthat hotel and room type behind one slow payment. At peak season with genuine\ncontention on a popular hotel, that turns a 3/sec system into an unusable one.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 1006,
   "width": 584,
   "height": 90,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100059,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700413,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The cost is that a PENDING state now exists and must be reconciled. A crash\nbetween commit and payment leaves inventory decremented for a reservation that\nwas never paid - so a sweeper releases pending reservations older than a\ntimeout. That is the saga trade: accept a transient inconsistency and a\ncompensating action, in exchange for not holding a lock across a call you do\nnot control.",
   "originalText": "The cost is that a PENDING state now exists and must be reconciled. A crash\nbetween commit and payment leaves inventory decremented for a reservation that\nwas never paid - so a sweeper releases pending reservations older than a\ntimeout. That is the saga trade: accept a transient inconsistency and a\ncompensating action, in exchange for not holding a lock across a call you do\nnot control.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "cn3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 1112,
   "width": 584,
   "height": 75,
   "strokeColor": "#b91c1c",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100060,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700420,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "And that sweeper is the design's most important background job. Pending\nreservations HOLD INVENTORY, so a sweeper that fails silently means\navailability slowly leaking away for no reason - a bug that presents as 'the\nhotel looks full but isn't', with nothing in the logs. It must be monitored on\nINVENTORY HELD BY PENDING ROWS, not merely on its own completion.",
   "originalText": "And that sweeper is the design's most important background job. Pending\nreservations HOLD INVENTORY, so a sweeper that fails silently means\navailability slowly leaking away for no reason - a bug that presents as 'the\nhotel looks full but isn't', with nothing in the logs. It must be monitored on\nINVENTORY HELD BY PENDING ROWS, not merely on its own completion.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d4",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1226,
   "width": 1680,
   "height": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100061,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700427,
   "isDeleted": false,
