   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700679,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The load-test target is the whole point: drive 1,000 concurrent booking attempts at a room type with EXACTLY ONE ROOM LEFT and\nassert that exactly one succeeds and 999 receive 409 - no oversell, no deadlock, no lost update. Separately, submit the same\nreservation_id 100 times concurrently and assert exactly one reservation exists. The correctness assertions ARE the test;\nthroughput is incidental.",
   "originalText": "The load-test target is the whole point: drive 1,000 concurrent booking attempts at a room type with EXACTLY ONE ROOM LEFT and\nassert that exactly one succeeds and 999 receive 409 - no oversell, no deadlock, no lost update. Separately, submit the same\nreservation_id 100 times concurrently and assert exactly one reservation exists. The correctness assertions ARE the test;\nthroughput is incidental.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
